{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-11-08 09:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE OPENS FIRST CLOUD REGION IN FRANCE', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, NOV. 8, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF ITS FIRST CLOUD REGION IN FRANCE TO SUPPORT THE INCREASING CLOUD COMPUTING DEMANDS OF PRIVATE AND PUBLIC SECTOR ORGANIZATIONS. THE ORACLE CLOUD MARSEILLE REGION WILL PROVIDE\xa0CUSTOMERS AND PARTNERS ACCESS TO ALL ORACLE CLOUD SERVICES TO DRIVE BUSINESS GROWTH.'}